  "notes": "Fire Tester 0.1.709b fixes BLE recovery after a cold-start memory refusal. Optional display staging stays reserved until guarded retries can prepare memory and satisfy both existing BLE heap floors. Medium generic allocations prefer PSRAM while the main framebuffer and explicit INTERNAL/DMA requests keep their existing placement. Cold AI diagnostics run outside the normal inference update frame and preserve operator learning. Verification includes 18 focused host suites, two normal boots with Twin Button connected, and nested QR help with focused Back, LEFT return and DOWN hold progress. Bounded runtime checks observed no unplanned loss; physical phone and RF endurance acceptance remain outstanding.",
